<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Borg-Warner started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Borg-Warner started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch has initiated coverage of Borg-Warner Automotive Inc with a near-term rating of accumulate and a long-term buy rating, the brokerage firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- No further information was immediately released. Analyst Ronald Buttarazzi was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Chicago-based supplier of automotive components and systems closed at 39-3/4 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
